PATENT NOTICE

The following components of this software implement algorithms and methods
for which patent applications are being prepared:

1. Resource-Adaptive Task Decomposition (RAD)
   - The method of monitoring embedded device resource state (RAM/CPU) and
     dynamically decomposing agent task steps at runtime to prevent execution
     failure on resource-constrained hardware.
   - Implemented in: core/resource_monitor.py, agent/executor.py

2. Sensor Failure Recovery Protocol
   - The formal classification of embedded sensor failures into a 4-type
     taxonomy (TIMEOUT, BAD_DATA, DISCONNECT, BUS_ERROR) and the hierarchical
     criticality-based recovery action selection method for embedded agentic
     AI systems.
   - Implemented in: agent/recovery.py

3. AgentEdge-Bench Benchmark Suite
   - The standardized 20-task benchmark methodology for evaluating agentic AI
     systems on embedded hardware, including the task categories, scoring
     metrics, and evaluation protocol.
   - Implemented in: benchmark/runner.py

Use of the above components in commercial products or in published research
must include appropriate citation of the AgentEdge project and the authors.
Licensing for commercial use of the patentable components may be obtained
by contacting the authors.

